fect for\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Landing page heroes ✦ Portfolio intros ✦ Creative studios ✦ Fashion campaigns ✦ Editorial websites ✦ Brand launches ✦ Photography showcases ✦ Art direction ✦ Product storytelling ✦ Visual headers\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Responsive by default\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized layouts for Desktop, Tablet and Mobile with touch-friendly interactions and adaptive pixel animations.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"computer_mouse\",\"emoji\":\"🖱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Included interactions\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Interactive cursor reveal ✦ Pixel animation ✦ Clickable links ✦ Smooth transitions ✦ Responsive layouts\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"––––––––\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart\",\"emoji\":\"❤\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Thank you so much for your support! I genuinely appreciate every download. I hope you have fun customizing this component and making it your own. Happy building!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Editorial hero with pixel reveal\",\"slug\":\"premium-pixel-hero\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593\",\"name\":\"felix strobel\",\"slug\":\"fs\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/8gv1pj67\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/QwmO7kE36B0ITfiC3MMH