UHmQKXYcZgVePZ\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://grid-background.framer.website/?editSite\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4fdfe3ed-ecd1-4761-a9df-b36c0c38e974\",\"name\":\"Layout\",\"slug\":\"layout\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"Io2EJNUHmQKXYcZgVePZ\"}},{\"id\":\"0bZhN6MqrJ0zFRlqpr2F\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Lifted Carousel\",\"body\":\"$5b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"✦ Put your best work front and center.\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create elegant editorial carousels with a lifted center card, smooth interactions and a clear visual hierarchy. Fully responsive, easy to customize and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ready to use in seconds. \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Make it completely your own with flexible controls for layout, styling and motion :)\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"gear\",\"emoji\":\"⚙\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" What you can customize\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easily adapt every part of the component to match your own brand and style.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Images ✦ Titles ✦ Subtitles ✦ Tags ✦ Tag position ✦ CTA labels ✦ Links ✦ Card size ✦ Card spacing ✦ Active elevation ✦ Border radius ✦ Typography ✦ Background color ✦ Text colors ✦ CTA styling ✦ Content spacing\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"dart\",\"emoji\":\"🎯\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Perfect for\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolios ✦ Featured projects ✦ Product highlights ✦ Landing pages ✦ Brand storytelling ✦ Editorial galleries ✦ Lifestyle showcases ✦ Creative studios\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Responsive by default\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized layouts for Desktop, Tablet and Mobile with smooth touch interactions and a perfectly centered active card.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"computer_mouse\",\"emoji\":\"🖱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Included interactions\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drag \u0026 swipe ✦ Click to focus ✦ Mobile arrow controls ✦ Active content reveal ✦ Smooth spring animations\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"link\",\"emoji\":\"🔗\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Live Preview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://unreal-studies-359278.framer.app/\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://unreal-studies-359278.framer.app/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"––––––––\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart\",\"emoji\":\"❤\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Thank you so much for your support! I genuinely appreciate every download. I hope you have fun customizing this component and making it your own. Happy building!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Centered image carousel with focus\",\"slug\":\"lifted-carousel\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593\",\"name\":\"felix strobel\",\"slug\":\"fs\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/8gv1pj67\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/019fbd57-8375-744d-bd6f-380bb84ae8a4.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e1d36-4618-75b6-8999-e144693b88b6\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":254,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-21T18:08:27.506Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T19:39:23.310Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-12T17:22:36.696Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://elevatedcarousel.framer.website\",\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://strobel-digital-products.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/c21e6be3-2018-4c92-9868-68651d221bfe\",\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"8f93ccfe-423c-47f2-b8ae-79e9e132012f\",\"name\":\"Carousels\",\"slug\":\"carousels\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"srHp5fdPcJgdWmuZ09mr\"}},{\"id\":\"CaDed4uVS4F4koHi8Ddp\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Eye Follow Button\",\"body\":\"$5c\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Eye Button is a playful, highly interactive UI component featuring animated eyes that respond to cursor movement in real time. The pupils smoothly follow the user's cursor, adding personality and delight to calls-to-action. Perfect for landing pages, portfolios, and creative interfaces.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed for flexibility, the component includes extensive customization options, letting you tailor both appearance and behavior to fit any brand or layout.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Customizable Properties\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Link: Add any URL or action\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Button Color: Customize the button background color\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Text: Edit the button label\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Text Color: Control the label color\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Padding: Adjust internal spacing for compact or spacious layouts\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Radius: Control button corner roundness\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eye Color: Set the eye background color\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pupil Color: Customize pupil color\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eye Count: Choose between one or two eyes\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eye Size: Adjust overall eye dimensions\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pupil Size: Control pupil scale\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eye Gap: Set spacing between eyes\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Speed: Adjust how quickly pupils follow the cursor\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Range: Control how far pupils can move\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Blinking: Enable or disable blinking\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Blinking Intensity: Fine-tune blink strength\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"With smooth motion, expressive animations, and detailed controls, the Eye Button brings character and interactivity to any Framer project while remaining easy to customize and integrate.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Support \u0026 Feedback\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Questions or issues with setup? Reach out at \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"aathif.design@gmail.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:aathif.design@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you like the component, I'd really appreciate a testimonial — just send it over to \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"aathif.design@gmail.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:aathif.design@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"introduction\":\"A button with eyes that move.\",\"slug\":\"eye-follow-button\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"145266b7-4a55-4a3b-80a1-ecffbd4346ee\",\"name\":\"Aathif Thajudeen\",\"slug\":\"aathif-thajudeen\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1014411/avatar-3hhQ5xrvrHyPqcZW2PL4D8an7mFCGm.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/145266b7-4a55-4a3b-80a1-ecffbd4346ee/019f51dc-4418-706c-afb7-f4a9c31e3a35.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019b9eb6-64c6-706d-baa9-5f92b6955555\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Made a small interactive component — Eye Button. Two eyes on a button that follow your cursor around, with an optional blink.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully customizable: eye count, size, color, speed, range, padding, radius, all of it. Good for landing pages or anywhere you want a bit of personality on a CTA.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":589,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-18T15:59:12.336Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-11T15:48:10.872Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-08T17:45:12.134Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Eye-Follow-Button-yMBK.js@UiZdcXLPs68fBczUfQ27\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://eye-follow-button.framer.website/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cd81cc33-d6cf-4630-8e59-b5b3100166ba\",\"name\":\"Buttons\",\"slug\":\"buttons\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"UiZdcXLPs68fBczUfQ27\"}},{\"id\":\"Ivn82YaFOfYI3tIkuGsA\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Reveal Text On Scroll\",\"body\":\"$5d\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Scroll-linked text animation, 12 presets\",\"slug\":\"revealtextonscroll\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"8234746c-39b5-463f-a016-4d51108fe035\",\"name\":\"Ali Themes\",\"slug\":\"ali-themes\",\"avatar\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/avatars/users/8234746c-39b5-463f-a016-4d51108fe035/n_TmMn5t4\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/Ivn82YaFOfYI3tIkuGsA/revealtextonscroll-eijK2OHNTnAQPmunfFWCf0oQMXtP6X\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019cdfa3-1f45-7f9b-a2e6-a93fface4b1c\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":358,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-05T04:31:53.024Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-11T11:20:27.066Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-03-12T01:22:15.493Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/ScrollRevealText-vXBxyx.js@ymLCSaN7wX7cJKeayNed\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://reveal-text-on-scroll.framer.website/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"7fe42fdd-1b16-4f5a-93b8-009488614de8\",\"name\":\"Typography\",\"slug\":\"typography\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"ymLCSaN7wX7cJKeayNed\"}},{\"id\":\"9u9EK5HRIJZmmb8nbwJZ\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Physics Sticker Wall\",\"body\":\"$5e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A full-frame interactive wall where your images become real physical objects. They fall with gravity, collide, and stack up naturally. Grab any sticker, drag it, and throw it with real momentum. Built on a 2D physics engine for motion that feels genuinely tactile.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drop in up to 10 images and they spawn as bouncy, grabbable stickers with slightly randomized size and rotation, so the pile always feels organic. Walls and floor keep everything inside the frame while the physics do the rest.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every feel is tunable from the property panel: gravity, bounciness, friction, throw power, and more. Dial it from a slow, heavy stack to a light, floaty bounce in seconds.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Real 2D physics: gravity, collisions, momentum\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Grab, drag, and throw with natural weight\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Up to 10 custom images as stickers\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Randomized size and rotation for an organic pile\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tunable gravity, bounciness, friction, and throw power\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Contained within the frame by floor and walls\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive and performance-friendly\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How to use\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Drop it into any frame, upload your images, and adjust the physics controls to taste. Great as an interactive hero, an about-page moment, or a playful section that invites people to touch it.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"physics-driven wall of images\",\"slug\":\"physics-sticker-wall\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"22f194ca-4704-4786-b94f-970f9d3548b7\",\"name\":\"Daniil Filatov\",\"slug\":\"filatovdesign\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/22f194ca-4704-4786-b94f-970f9d3548b7/3dpat02y\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/22f194ca-4704-4786-b94f-970f9d3548b7/zm9ojhlk\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(20 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f3925-a944-710e-96db-9a3653299085\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One prompt to Claude Sonnet 5 and this is what came out. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Added my own generations, and here's a finished hero section. Honestly impressed. Grab, throw, stack. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Curious what you all think.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":358,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-06T20:36:37.257Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T20:36:37.257Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-06T20:36:37.250Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/PhysicsStickerWall-zHPbfb.js@e1ECKBDS8JUJUEvoBub9\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://agreeable-surprise-505449.framer.app/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"e1ECKBDS8JUJUEvoBub9\"}},{\"id\":\"v9Fx3iJTH5DewzynfvaA\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Silky Mouse Trail\",\"body\":\"$5f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Silky Mouse Trail is a high-performance cursor trail effect that renders a fluid ribbon following the user’s pointer. It uses a canvas-based system with custom physics to simulate inertia, damping, and speed-based motion.\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The trail dynamically adjusts width and color based on cursor velocity, creating a natural, silk-like flow. It runs outside the canvas in preview and publish mode, while staying invisible in the editor using a canvas guard.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Silky Mouse Trail includes the following features out of the box:\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"• Physics-Based Motion — Smooth trailing effect with inertia, damping, and velocity influence• Speed Reactive Width — Trail expands and contracts based on cursor speed• Gradient Color Blending — Seamless transition between head and tail colors• High Performance Canvas Rendering — Efficient drawing loop using requestAnimationFrame• Stable Motion Handling — Prevents jitter and glitches with smart edge calculations• Pointer Tracking — Follows cursor with accurate and responsive updates• Auto Resize Support — Adjusts canvas resolution based on screen size and pixel ratio• Canvas Guard — Hidden in editor, active only in preview and live mode• Non-Interactive Layer — Pointer events are disabled so it never blocks UI\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Property Controls\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Length — Controls the number of segments in the trailHead Width — Sets the thickness of the trail at the frontTail Width — Sets the thickness at the end of the trailHead Color — Defines the color near the cursorTail Color — Defines the color at the end of the trailDamping — Adjusts how tightly the trail follows the cursorMax Speed — Sets the speed threshold for width scalingZ-Index — Controls stacking order above other layers\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ideal Use Cases\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"• Portfolio websites that need a unique cursor effect• Agency and studio sites with strong visual identity• Landing pages that benefit from subtle motion• Interactive experiences and creative projects\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It adds a polished, modern feel without interfering with layout or interactions.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Fluid trail with dynamic motion\",\"slug\":\"silky-mouse-trail\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"0377da32-5157-43ad-9c57-e949e915db9e\",\"name\":\"Daniyal Habib\",\"slug\":\"daniyalweb\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1271714/avatar-8E77IXnX9HLKLrOPuUGBp3gf2I7AYE.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/v9Fx3iJTH5DewzynfvaA/silky-mouse-trail-WGiXvnguoyUweMyuO4MRwM1Q9Eqx8w\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019dba97-25bc-7d8a-9511-789005d1ac66\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":123,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":6},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-15T17:40:14.882Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-23T06:49:31.889Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-23T13:46:01.020Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://silky-mouse-trail.framer.website/\",\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://daniyalweb.gumroad.com/l/azndt?wanted=true\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"KpAM3VJxX0DaFhjqVBQm\"}},{\"id\":\"c8YZ4BJltkQsMCOM2t9A\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"SpiderEffect\",\"body\":\"$60\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SpiderCircleEffect\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SpiderCircleEffect\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is an interactive animated dot-field component that creates a smooth “spider-like” motion across a network of dots. As the main point moves through the scene, it connects with nearby dots and generates clean, dynamic line effects that react beautifully to cursor movement.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for hero sections, landing pages, portfolios, creative websites, futuristic backgrounds, SaaS visuals, and interactive UI experiments.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Description\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bring your interface to life with a responsive spider-style particle animation. The component moves through a field of dots, creating elegant connections and motion trails that feel organic, modern, and playful. You can fully customize the colors, dot count, dot size, line transparency, movement speed, easing, reaction distance, and connection behavior.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you want a subtle animated background or a bold interactive visual effect, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SpiderCircleEffect\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" gives you flexible controls to match your design style.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Animated spider-like movement through dots\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Interactive cursor reaction\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Customizable dot count, size, and colors\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Adjustable main point size and movement speed\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smooth easing controls\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dynamic connecting lines\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optional background toggle\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Great for dark, futuristic, creative, and tech-inspired layouts\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easy to customize directly from component properties\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Suggested Marketplace Short Description\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An interactive spider-style dot animation that moves through particles, connects nearby dots, and creates smooth reactive visual effects for modern websites.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Crawling Spider Through Dots\",\"slug\":\"spidereffect\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"47745ef1-855e-412c-a101-305ac078cd49\",\"name\":\"FrameSpace\",\"slug\":\"framespace\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/129533/avatar-CUOFZiJvUMrfCqPnaTe2BesapDWMrY.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/47745ef1-855e-412c-a101-