1:13.291Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-15T14:07:06.949Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/ImageScroller-kjnj.js@aP86nmOJy6tPfN0rRzeL\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://inventive-posterity-548984.framer.app\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"aP86nmOJy6tPfN0rRzeL\"}},{\"id\":\"vvbxxEOK34GFbmuaZMnc\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"GalleryStack\",\"body\":\"\u003ch3\u003eGalleryStack - Infinite Click Gallery\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBy DEVIQUE Studio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA modern, looping photo stack built for creators.Each click reshuffles your images with smooth, cinematic motion - sliding forward and looping endlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for photography portfolios, creative studios, or storytelling layouts.Fully responsive and code-free - just replace the 8 image slots with your own and publish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e• Interactive, infinite photo rotation• 8 customizable image slots• Clean, minimal design• Works on all breakpoints• Built 100% in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to use:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd \u003cem\u003eGalleryStack\u003c/em\u003e to your canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplace default images (1–8) with your own.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview and publish - your gallery is live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eCrafted with passion by DEVIQUE Studio - bringing motion to minimalism.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Click-to-rotate photo stack\",\"slug\":\"gallerystack\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"954acd83-ca10-4d69-b86d-786565b70335\",\"name\