✦ Make your content the center of attention.\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create elegant card carousels with a centered focus, smooth interactions and a clean editorial layout. Fully responsive, easy to customize and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ready to use in seconds.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Make it completely your own with flexible controls for layout, styling and motion :)\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"gear\",\"emoji\":\"⚙\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" What you can customize\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easily adapt every part of the component to match your own brand and style.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Images ✦ Headlines ✦ Text ✦ Button labels ✦ Links ✦ Active \u0026 inactive scale ✦ Card gap ✦ Mobile overlap ✦ Border radius ✦ Border width ✦ Overlay color \u0026 opacity ✦ Shadow intensity ✦ Animation speed ✦ Typography ✦ Background color ✦ Indicator color\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"dart\",\"emoji\":\"🎯\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Perfect for\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio sections ✦ Project showcases ✦ Service highlights ✦ Case study previews ✦ Product storytelling ✦ Landing pages ✦ Brand presentations ✦ Feature sliders\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Responsive by default\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized layouts for Desktop, Tablet and Mobile with smooth touch interactions and perfectly centered cards.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"computer_mouse\",\"emoji\":\"🖱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Included interactions\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drag \u0026 swipe ✦ Click to focus ✦ Keyboard navigation ✦ Dot indicators ✦ CTA buttons ✦ Smooth transitions\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"link\",\"emoji\":\"🔗\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Live Preview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://versatile-desert-600216.framer.app/\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://versatile-desert-600216.framer.app/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"––––––––\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart\",\"emoji\":\"❤\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Thank you so much for your support! I genuinely appreciate every download. I hope you have fun customizing this component and making it your own. Happy building!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Interactive focus Card carousel\",\"slug\":\"velocity-carousel\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593\",\"name\":\"felix strobel\",\"slug\":\"fs\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/8gv1pj67\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/zMA5oWXOywba0ZpyE4TW/velocity-carousel-nHasoXjPo8pueXW2VehsvUqhfZUYo3\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e7a94-5422-732c-88ea-324ca8d9feb0\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":332,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\