verlays for readability\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVertical compact layout, ideal for side-scrolling carousels\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIncludes customizable titles and paragraphs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for portfolios, showcases, and featured content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive by default — works beautifully across devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eUse Cases:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative portfolios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct feature highlights\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject timelines or step-based journeys\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHero sections with minimal footprint\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive galleries or image-based navigation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Images With Expanded Cards\",\"slug\":\"expanded-card\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"1424ba90-0b4e-4d0c-b165-8f3f7a092e75\",\"name\":\"Shaigexp\",\"slug\":\"shaigexp\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29216/avatar-C4PJ8E5avycwH0vgAiZtLyUAh0D422.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/TwLWnR1XzfGuWXULGSDZ/expanded-card-aKM9bvPTnvTKE9sjPUC4wQwBpWl8bl\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0198a3c9-330f-743a-9f95-078ccbffca8e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":260,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-08-08T12:21:22.842Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-25T07:17:09.321Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-08-13T14:15:28.783Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Expanded-Card-Tf0T.js@eQAyLIpgdsn5jzRZJ7tW\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://glorious-rule-603893.framer.app/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"eQAyLIpgdsn5jzRZJ7tW\"}},{\"id\":\"jCjsua5XYEOMM3R0pfOV\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"CMS Warp Gallery\",\"body\":\"$71\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Infinite Scroll Warp Gallery (CMS)\",\"slug\":\"cms-warp-gallery\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"9456ae13-3e4e-4f6b-a2bf-55e8823db42e\",\"name\":\"THE DESIGN FUTURIST\",\"slug\":\"thedesignfuturist\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/994161/avatar-jDfu6hxAr17MEzTUI9aOrKg5fIih8z.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/jCjsua5XYEOMM3R0pfOV/cms-warp-gallery-Vzu8KkDFLqa3xe8XK2FgI81IU1Z76b\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e204d-4831-7685-b7cd-43e4884db33e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":198,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-22T08:45:58.451Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-04T07:21:01.586Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-13T07:46:36.209Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-17T06:06:30.102Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://forceful-goblin-668509.framer.app/\",\"price\":\"15\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_0062Wamd1TqukqmQPvissvjHRrwHz8nJF7hYY0YLMyP\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"e37e310f-bced-42c5-9709-c0a59a28dd3b\",\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"pPd8KtawO42XC8YGTdxT\"}},{\"id\":\"GeNCn6HAnt8L5smsNSkk\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Flap Split Reveal\",\"body\":\"$72\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flap Split Reveal\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" creates a bold, mechanical text animation inspired by retro split-flap displays. Each line of text is covered by a solid color block that splits into two halves and flips away — choose whether it opens from the center outward or the edges inward, on either the horizontal or vertical axis, for four reveal styles in one component. Fully responsive: line count and block sizing recalculate automatically as your layout resizes, so the effect always matches your text.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Four reveal modes: Horizontal or Vertical, Center-Out or Edges-In\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully responsive — blocks recalculate on resize automatically\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Staggered line-by-line animation\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full typography and SEO tag control\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Adjustable block padding and corner radius\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scroll-triggered or on-load animation\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Properties\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — The paragraph that will be animated. Each line is measured and revealed individually. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SEO Tag\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Sets the HTML heading tag (H1, H2, paragraph, etc.) for accessibility and SEO. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Font\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Choose the font family for your text. Supports all fonts in your Framer project. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Text Color\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Sets the color of the revealed text. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Alignment\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Controls the alignment of the paragraph within its container. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Direction\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Options: Horizontal or Vertical, Center-Out or Edges-In. Sets the split axis and reveal mode. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Duration\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Sets the flip time for each block. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stagger Delay\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Delay between each consecutive line's reveal. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Reveal Color\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — The solid color covering the text before it's revealed. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Line Spacing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — The space between lines of the effect. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Block Pad X / Block Pad Y\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Horizontal and vertical padding around each block, independent of the text. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Corners\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Sets the corner radius of each block. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Trigger\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Options: On Load, On Scroll. Easing — Sets the animation curve for the flip. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Padding\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — Overall padding around the component.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Support \u0026 Assistance \"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Questions or issues? Reach out at \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"danielgrafix12@gmail.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:danielgrafix12@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and I'll get back to you as soon as possible.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Flip text open in 4 directions\",\"slug\":\"flap-split-reveal\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"7202e78d-eada-41ce-a524-6063cf18b612\",\"name\":\"Daniel Moreno\",\"slug\":\"daniel-grafix\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7202e78d-eada-41ce-a524-6063cf18b612/1igapi4t\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7202e78d-eada-41ce-a524-6063cf18b612/01a01c96-577e-702e-96df-c7cdc7f086d9.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01c97-60e8-74c3-a399-f5c0a127ebb5\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wipe Text Reveal has been my best-selling component. Now it gets a sequel: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flap Split Reveal\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Blocks that flip open in 4 directions — horizontal or vertical, center-out or edges-in — to reveal your text.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free for 1 week. Countdown live in the preview \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"point_down\",\"emoji\":\"👇\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":14,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-20T00:34:37.411Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T17:00:40.820Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-20T00:34:37.407Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://flapsplitreveal.framer.website\",\"price\":\"4\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_ajDkOM29mObQOF7pubm9QI