g\u003eA component for vibrant and memorable interactions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern, clean, folder-style cards. They\u0026#39;re fully editable: upload your own images and backgrounds, adjust the size and colors. You can easily adapt the card\u0026#39;s appearance to your design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey Features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWOW Effect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth hover animation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn engaging user experience\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully editable component\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for vibrant and memorable websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFormat support — .jpeg, .png\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"About this component\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A component for vibrant and memorable interactions\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern, clean, folder-style cards. They're fully editable: upload your own images and backgrounds, adjust the size and colors. You can easily adapt the card's appearance to your design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"WOW Effect\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smooth hover animation\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An engaging user experience\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully editable component\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ideal for vibrant and memorable websites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Format support — .jpeg, .png\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Encouraging to click\",\"slug\":\"card-folder\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ab7c3e96-c7db-4058-8c57-3baeabd8685a\",\"name\":\"Gennady Muzych\",\"slug\":\"gennady\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1453376/avatar-1C0SycVwe3yFk3MCvWp1rwOlrlClFt.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ab7c3e96-c7db-4058-8c57-3baeabd8685a/kdpbo1e0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 53% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f3c01-b438-71fb-88be-24fbbf537a4b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I've published my new component. I'd love your likes and comments\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":239,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-07T09:56:12.421Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T07:26:35.540Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-07T09:56:12.415Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://cards-folder.framer.website/\",\"price\":\"6\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://app.lava.top/en/products/66dd307c-d8cb-4098-8422-685491c9c0a2?currency=USD\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"6