polar.sh/polar_cl_VSb0ydpnyaxKxFCGQnhUngTRANYRc2lqqHana2OW6v2\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"5c50a4d9-4405-49ca-8956-4909a204480d\",\"name\":\"Sections\",\"slug\":\"sections\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"XlQNwliO6JX6O0AzA0nx\"}},{\"id\":\"4PruHtTPlyzuwTEUPDtO\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Morphing Text\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEmphasize keywords with the morphing text animation component. \u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCustomizable Properties\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMix and match keywords freely\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdjust font, font size, and font color\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFine-tune animation timing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlign text in any direction (left, center, right)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHave Questions?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"mailto:hello@thedesignfuturist.zip\\\"\u003ehello@thedesignfuturist.zip\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://thedesignfuturist.zip\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/description-image-b0qjx7pr-e9KXhpr2h1ujniK0RNMUdi4L0VDupK\\\" alt=\\\"THE DESIGN FUTURIST : Framer Component Library\\\" data-link=\\\"https://thedesignfuturist.zip\\\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eTHE DESIGN FUTURIST : Framer Component Library\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Morphing text cycle\",\"slug\":\"morphing-text\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"9456ae13-3e4e-4f6b-a2bf-55e8823db42e\",\"name\":\"THE DESIGN FUTURIST\",\"slug\":\"thedesignfuturist\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/994161/avatar-jDfu6hxAr17MEzTUI9aOrKg5fIih8z.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/4PruHtTPlyzuwTEUPDtO/morphing-text-hUV6LDXJ5lGCqN1ew4QErkZ3GEwKUO\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01987fed-0f73-7423-915c-06285d1eb0fa\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":165,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-08-06T11:51:58.408Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-14T08:32:18.948Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-08-06T15:08:19.187Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://text-morphing-animation.framer.website/\",\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_NEv8GKBXbs2j5CHXV5yECZOLYVa27P2scRpKW05bEYP\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"7fe42fdd-1b16-4f5a-93b8-009488614de8\",\"name\":\"Typography\",\"slug\":\"typography\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"HHvMhrcBUMOAz7AInCMp\"}},{\"id\":\"OvJXPpBAgt54N2IV64IT\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ASCII Flow Trail\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eASCII Flow Trail\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate mesmerizing particle trails with animated ASCII characters that follow mouse movement or flow autonomously. Perfect for adding a unique, retro-tech aesthetic to hero sections, backgrounds, or interactive showcases.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e5 dithering styles (Halftone, Bayer, Floyd-Steinberg, Atkinson)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCustomizable trail physics with momentum and turbulence\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFlexible color system with tint and blend modes\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMouse tracking or autonomous movement modes\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFully responsive canvas rendering\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOptimized performance with adjustable quality\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eTransform any surface into a dynamic ASCII art canvas. From subtle ambient effects to bold interactive experiences, this component brings text-based particle systems to life with extensive customization options.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUse cases:\u003c/strong\u003e Landing pages, portfolio sites, creative agencies, tech products, artistic installations, interactive backgrounds.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"ascii-flow-trail\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a652ff89-b6f1-4519-82cf-f99a959cfb72\",\"name\":\"Vishesh Tiwari\",\"slug\":\"madebyvishesh\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1079385/avatar-4BursnvazrObjFY9eHktdFHQGB4UwO.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/OvJXPpBAgt54N2IV64IT/ascii-flow-trail-fwPtufa1MLCGI8KSgr8HWUeTJaWF1z\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a118e-0299-7b49-8122-37c5ad3b7e07\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":378,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-14T15:54:07.676Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-07T12:44:33.735Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-23T14:51:50.809Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Ascii-FlowTrail-1wMf.js@Yz3XgjaqoKr87S5I6u5z\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://asciiflowtrail.framer.website/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"Yz3XgjaqoKr87S5I6u5z\"}},{\"id\":\"jrPVt0tAoquSqfD5qdow\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Animation loader\",\"body\":\"$79\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A percentage loader animation compo