 Mode — live preview frame color, glow, dots and bar controls\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully responsive — adapts phone size and layout for mobile and tablet\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full property controls: colors, fonts, sizes, CTA, and theme defaults\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What's Included\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unlimited scroll-synced slides with image, title, description, CTA\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built-in circular reveal dark/light mode system\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"2 frame finishes — Black and Titanium\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"12+ property control groups\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Works out of the box, zero config\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How It Works\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"orderedList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drop the component onto your canvas\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Add your slides with images, titles, and descriptions\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pick your colors and theme default, and you're live\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"type\":null,\"start\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Cases\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"App landing pages \u0026 mobile app showcases\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SaaS feature walkthroughs \u0026 product tours\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Startup \u0026 tech product launch pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"E-commerce app marketing pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fintech \u0026 banking app showcases\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio sites for app designers \u0026 developers\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Agency case study \u0026 client showcase pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Health \u0026 fitness app landing pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Editorial scroll-storytelling layouts\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product feature highlight sections\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Keywords\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"phone scroll component, iphone mockup framer, scroll showcase, app landing page framer, scroll-driven animation, iphone frame component, dark mode toggle, circular reveal animation, parallax phone mockup, product showcase, app mockup component, scroll sync slides, mobile app showcase, phone component, sticky scroll animation, theme toggle component\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Animated scroll phone showcase\",\"slug\":\"phone-scroll-pro\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"bcb94bf9-7aa9-40d7-b681-19421ce62bd3\",\"name\":\"Ahmet Loca\",\"slug\":\"ahmet-loca\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/107742/avatar-FjO7QBJgG4WwbY6uS5eymN55rN0btF.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/bcb94bf9-7aa9-40d7-b681-19421ce62bd3/q7j2f0gk\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ed4c3-5485-70e9-8761-52e8e8d9968d\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"PhoneScrollPro is a scroll-driven iPhone showcase for Framer. Each scroll moves through a new slide with synced image, headline, description, and background color, all wrapped in a realistic 3D phone frame. Includes a circular-reveal dark/light mode toggle, ambient glow, 3D tilt, and per-slide CTA buttons. Perfect for app landing pages, SaaS feature walkthroughs, and product showcases.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":157,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-17T08:47:11.459Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-27T08:52:54.729Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-17T08:47:11.456Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://phonescrollpro.framer.website/\",\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://ahmetloca.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/50156ea1-8827-4c