:\" Perfect for\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolios ✦ Lifestyle showcases ✦ Service highlights ✦ Case studies ✦ Editorial landing pages ✦ Product storytelling ✦ Brand presentations ✦ Creative projects\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Responsive by default\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized layouts for Desktop, Tablet and Mobile with adaptive arc layouts and smooth touch interactions.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"computer_mouse\",\"emoji\":\"🖱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Included interactions\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drag \u0026 swipe ✦ Scroll navigation ✦ Arrow controls ✦ Click to focus ✦ Linked CTAs ✦ Smooth spring animations\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"link\",\"emoji\":\"🔗\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Live Preview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://just-yards-913081.framer.app/\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://just-yards-913081.framer.app/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"––––––––\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart\",\"emoji\":\"❤\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Thank you so much for your support! I genuinely appreciate every download. I hope you have fun customizing this component and making it your own. Happy building!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Curved image carousel\",\"slug\":\"arc-focus-carousel\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593\",\"name\":\"felix strobel\",\"slug\":\"fs\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/8gv1pj67\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2179b778-b2d7-4c1e-ab27-60e7e12a6593/019fbd58-ba19-73f1-9afc-310f2146d054.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019dd308-f913-77d0-adff-e2aa96836d66\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":209,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-21T18:04:25.538Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-04T19:40:30.203Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-28T07:41:13.875Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/ArcImageCarousel-jkxOCN.js@5kLHByzB3T1YZ72nIUmo\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://just-yards-913081.framer.app/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"8f93ccfe-423c-47f2-b8ae-79e9e132012f\",\"name\":\"Carousels\",\"slug\":\"carousels\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"5kLHByzB3T1YZ72nIUmo\"}},{\"id\":\"g2P5pMK1acsdX3cwyXTu\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Text Video Mask\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eWith this component, you can add dynamic video content to your website with text masking. You get full control to customize the text that mask your video and native text properties in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get include\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA component with editable text for masking\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTotal control over text sizing properties in all visual\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVideo Controls such looping, autoplay and mute\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eText and backgroun colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVideo via Upload or Url\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest suited towards;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio showcases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGallery work\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA note about performance;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eI recommend you direct uploads only if your video shot is small(ie 1-5mbs). For larget videos, I recommend using external hosting and then add video via url for for performace\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat's it. Grab it and customize in minutes\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"text-video-mask\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2ce00227-e754-4780-87eb-5ab30c5e5271\",\"name\":\"KIBERU YAHAYA\",\"slug\":\"yahya\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/98373/avatar-p7HylKLBveG3VnulZPJqNFLNgEe2HI.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/g2P5pMK1acsdX3cwyXTu/text-video-mask-WCpJVybL3VGyZyPNgIfvjMXx8FFSnl\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199a395-818b-734f-b6ed-9127819ddef7\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":258,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-09-27T19:41:35.667Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-02T04:17:26.414Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-02T06:21:48.299Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/TextVideoMask-l1wR.js@5D05uprmgYr7nCdN85TJ\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://texttovideomask.framer.website/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"7fe42fdd-1b16-4f5a-93b8-009488614de8\",\"name\":\"Typography\",\"slug\":\"typography\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"5D05uprmgYr7nCdN85TJ\"}},{\"id\":\"z5gbHQ5J09euKajl0pY8\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Circular UI Slider\",\"body\":\"$90\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Add a premium 3D spatial rotating ring layout to your Framer projects with smart depth fading, physics-based swipe interactions, and responsive auto-fill spacing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Real-time 3D spatial positioning and rotation\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smooth physics-based drag and swipe interactions\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smart auto-spacing with equal arc gap calculations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dynamic depth fading and intelligent z-index sorting\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Adjustable camera tilt and 3D perspective distortion\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Highly optimized requestAnimationFrame performance\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\"