feature highlights, reminders, moodboards, checklists, dashboards, playful notes, and interactive landing page details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5 built-in sticky note color styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRealistic curled paper hover animation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEditable text and typography controls\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHorizontal and vertical text alignment\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdjustable padding\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResizable fixed-layout component\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks directly on canvas, preview, and published sites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A customizable sticky note component with soft paper colors, editable typography, and a subtle curled-corner hover effect. Choose from classic post-it shades like yellow, pink, blue, green, and orange, then adjust the text, alignment, padding, font, size, line height, and letter spacing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Great for feature highlights, reminders, moodboards, checklists, dashboards, playful notes, and interactive landing page details.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features:\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"5 built-in sticky note color styles\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Realistic curled paper hover animation\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Editable text and typography controls\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Horizontal and vertical text alignment\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Adjustable padding\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Resizable fixed-layout component\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Works directly on canvas, preview, and published sites\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Fully customizable sticky notes\",\"slug\":\"sticky-note\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"89f9d2ee-af24-449f-a3ba-237cd04885a8\",\"name\":\"vasp\",\"slug\":\"vasp\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/89f9d2ee-af24-449f-a3ba-237cd04885a8/v9v9uxf5\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/89f9d2ee-af24-449f-a3ba-237cd04885a8/019f797e-95d2-770a-b6cf-60e28cac1725.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f7980-1c98-714c-a768-9e109b092082\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Just published a free realistic sticky note component. It includes soft post-it color styles, editable typography, alignment controls, adjustable padding, and a subtle curled-corner hover animation. Useful for notes, checklists, reminders, moodboards, and playful landing page details.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":158,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:31:06.444Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:45:40.643Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-19T08:31:06.439Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/SticktyNote-M10jET.js@gon3ts1AruK6LZhkH4aM\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://unreal-seat-473848.framer.app\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3a855006-6097-4489-b33b-8024cb26633e\",\"name\":\"Interactions\",\"slug\":\"interactions\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"gon3ts1AruK6LZhkH4aM\"}},{\"id\":\"txumXqF6oNNY29fNw1zS\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"StudioShowcase Stack\",\"body\":\"$a4\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"StudioShowcase Stack is a minimal, studio-style stacked carousel built for showcasing work. Use images or videos per card, with optional mute control and global video looping for smooth previews. Tune the look with shadow strength and background-card clarity to match any brand. Ideal for case study highlights, agency homepages, and curated project galleries.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Key Features\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Interactive card stack: Cards fan out and overlap like a deck; click any card to bring it forward\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smooth, natural animations: Cards glide into place with a soft, bouncy motion\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Images or videos, your choice: Mix and match per card, upload your own files or paste a link\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Video sound control: Built-in mute/unmute button on each video card\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Looks great on any screen: Automatically resizes and adjusts spacing for mobile, tablet, and desktop\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pick your starting card: Choose whether the stack opens on the left, center, or right card\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully customizable style: Change corner roundness, borders, shadow depth, and overlay darkness: all with simple sliders and color pickers, no code needed\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Add up to 12 cards: Perfect for portfolios, project showcases, or featured work\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"customYoutube\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/198K98cfjB8?color=white\u0026autoplay=0\u0026controls=1\u0026rel=0\",\"width\":700,\"height\":395,\"caption\":\"\",\"data-youtube-url\":\"https://youtu.be/198K98cfjB8\"}},{\"type\":\"customImage\",\"attrs\":{\"alt\":\"\",\"src\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/description-image-39g3bg1z-TG0kcRuH8iyyBgh9bOhcK2jkEYKJZJ\",\"link\":null,\"caption\":\"\",\"uploadId\":null}}]},\"introduction\":\"showcase carousel (Photo\u0026Video)\",\"slug\":\"studioshowcase-stack\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"4b6fcd8f-a982-4dfd-a445-68ca06faffec\",\"name\":\"Rayan Yasser\",\"slug\":\"rayan-yasser\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/581419/avatar-YkJwZ1FYIh403vC5X1WGq1BaayIxhv.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/txumXqF6oNNY29fNw1zS/studioshowcase-stack-yQ4XLt6Lxoi6QaVXjgqoyEBxhVkIcg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(7 75% 19%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c669b-14d0-779d-ab3e-77953398aa5b\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{