\",\"text\":\"AuraCursor is an ambient, cursor-reactive glow effect component for Framer. A soft plasma-like aura trails behind the mouse pointer, blending vivid color streaks against a dark canvas to create a living, atmospheric background layer. Built to add a premium, cinematic touch to hero sections and full-page backgrounds without any external assets.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Cursor-reactive aura trail that follows mouse movement in real time\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smooth, organic trailing motion with soft glow and color blending\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Customizable color palette for the aura's core and trailing streaks\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Adjustable glow intensity and fade speed\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Works as a full-bleed background layer — drops into any Framer frame at 100% size\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lightweight, GPU-friendly rendering with no external dependencies\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully responsive — scales cleanly across desktop and tablet\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Works out of the box — no setup needed\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Cases\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Landing page and hero section backgrounds\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio and personal branding sites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Creative agency and studio pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SaaS and product launch pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Music, art and creative showcase sites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Event and conference landing pages\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Keywords\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"aura cursor, cursor trail effect, mouse trail animation, cursor glow framer, ambient background effect, interactive cursor effect, plasma glow background, framer cursor animation, glow trail effect, animated background framer\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"WebGL fluid mouse trail for Framer\",\"slug\":\"aura-cursor\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"bcb94bf9-7aa9-40d7-b681-19421ce62bd3\",\"name\":\"Ahmet Loca\",\"slug\":\"ahmet-loca\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/107742/avatar-FjO7QBJgG4WwbY6uS5eymN55rN0btF.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/bcb94bf9-7aa9-40d7-b681-19421ce62bd3/6bnj1z4l\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{