e},\"comments\":{\"count\":8},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-19T11:59:00.287Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-18T09:03:11.432Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-10T10:01:34.915Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/CMSSliderPro-tDXAtC.js@4XL3NSvLcJPQTW4s1tN8\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://cmssliderpro.framer.website/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"8f93ccfe-423c-47f2-b8ae-79e9e132012f\",\"name\":\"Carousels\",\"slug\":\"carousels\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"4XL3NSvLcJPQTW4s1tN8\"}},{\"id\":\"SJLVc49yFWGYGI56aUO5\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Curtain Reveal Anim\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003ePreloader animation with smooth animation that reveals underneath content like a stage curtain. SImply change color to customize. A code override has been attached to the preloader animation to stop page scroll for 3 seconds until animation is finished.To change delay time - open \\\"PreloaderDelay\\\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/description-image-a3xxv95u-S0oDdSr1WSFwoEFAqsimDkH9UunsLA\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe locate '\u003cstrong\u003ewindow.scrollTo(0, scrollY)}, 3000)' \u003c/strong\u003e in code\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/description-image-a3xxv95u-XmfRDMDEG5tmpJaQcrsoWsKLwAoWJf\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eChange '3000' to any number of your choice. Note that 3000ms = 3 second. Enjoy\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Curtain Reveal preloader animation\",\"slug\":\"curtain-reveal-anim\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"cebfa30c-d6df-47a8-9d6d-6d08662c8cb6\",\"name\":\"Hey I'm Ozenua\",\"slug\":\"forx-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cebfa30c-d6df-47a8-9d6d-6d08662c8cb6/g3jgbzuh\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/SJLVc49yFWGYGI56aUO5/curtain-reveal-anim-JpUuJQJCvPh6wz82s3HgxqQh9C0w61\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e91cb-93ff-7810-8c84-239380b92514\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":342,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-15T01:52:22.509Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-30T14:06:51.253Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-04T08:41:38.559Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-17T06:04:24.710Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Interactive-Components-Preloader-LoadScreen-j67ejr.js@avLwyyJ0iIdSjc2rmvzz\",\"previewUrl\":\"https://smart-site-282803.framer.app/\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"5c50a4d9-4405-49ca-8956-4909a204480d\",\"name\":\"Sections\",\"slug\":\"sections\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"avLwyyJ0iIdSjc2rmvzz\"}},{\"id\":\"eg1umj3uyBiIe9RwvFcE\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Announcement Nav\",\"body\":\"$ab\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Inspired by \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"0365a5a1-29eb-426a-bb58-af7fe6b72ccf\",\"slug\":\"tilljanek\",\"label\":\"Till Janek\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart_hands\",\"emoji\":\"🫶\"}}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"About\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Announcement Nav is a floating pill navigation with a built-in, dismissible announcement ticker. Up to four messages move continuously across the bar, supported by a layered entrance animation, typing text effect, rolling hover interactions, and a smooth hover slowdown for easier reading.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What you can customize\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built entirely with native Framer elements and customizable from the properties panel. Control the announcement visibility, close button, badge, four news messages, links, new-tab behavior, navigation labels, icons, colors, gradients, glow, and animation timing without code.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Great for (examples)\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Just a few ideas, use it anywhere you want to keep visitors updated without adding a separate banner:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Marketplace websites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"E-commerce stores\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SaaS websites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product launches\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Startup websites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Feature announcements\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Changelog pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Event websites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Waitlist pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sales campaigns\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product drops\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Premium Framer templates\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Share your build\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you ship something cool with it, post it on X and tag me \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"@Matthias_Oel\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://x.com/Matthias_Oel\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", or send it over. I’d love to see what you create.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Need help?\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Questions or feedback? Reach me anytime: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"matthias@lmvision.de\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:matthias@lmvision.de\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" or on X \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"@Matthias_Oel.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://x.com/Matthias_Oel\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Turn every update into a moment\",\"slug\":\"announcement-nav\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"94772ad7-baad-4763-bd35-365704374dc3\",\"name\":\"Matt\",\"slug\":\"matthias-oel\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/94772ad7-baad-4763-bd35-365704374dc3/tlc8u3mt\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/94772ad7-baad-4763-bd35-365704374dc3/01a0189a-2718-7497-bd53-a11c97eaa3f2.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a0189c-83f2-7499-b2f9-d9869d649d64\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Keep every visitor in the loop.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Announcement Nav\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" gives your latest news a continuously moving space directly below the navigation.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Support it and make it yours \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heart_hands\",\"emoji\":\"🫶\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":26,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T06:01:45.170Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:40:00.705Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-19T06:01:45.166Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://announcement-nav.framer.website\",\"price\":\"9\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_IFCNvIkPnluiEQmdxPk1LFLoyuZlui24KAx4h3F6BGc\",\"workshop\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4c691677-c621-4041-a908-cbc2d3272658\",\"name\":\"Navigation\",\"slug\":\"navigation\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"s8WyENlyb8fWmnu47d6N\"}},{\"id\":\"l4G9GvP8JuAwKHBVPu4B\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"VideosGallery3D\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e3D Tunnel Gallery\u003c/strong\u003e component creates an immersive fly-through effect where videos travel forward in 3D space, generating a cinematic tunnel illusion. Each video animates independently with randomized lateral offsets, producing an organic, futuristic flow. The centered neon-style title adds a high-impact focal point while maintaining readability amidst motion. Easily customize duration, colors, font, and media through Framer controls. Perfect for showcasing edits, reels, product clips, motion graphics, or branding visuals. With hover-pause interaction, visitors can inspect each video as it passes through the scene. An eye-catching, modern, and memorable way to elevate any hero section or portfolio page.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"high-impact 3D galleries\",\"slug\":\"videosgallery3d\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ff121138-ac98-4c86-a230-12c0d7db0e59\",\"name\":\"Pixels\",\"slug\":\"pixels\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ff121138-ac98-4c86-a230-12c0d7db0e59/9jje7ugc\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/components/l4G9GvP8JuAwKHBVPu4B/videosgallery3d-DAOdlhHHhQQKibk4gabXbKtZnTaV4i\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019b0061-7f9c-7922-8f8e-e969289a5a5f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":45,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-28T01:57:34.804Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-02T01:44:55.311Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-08T23:52:28.316Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"component\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://centered-future-205322.framer.app/\",\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_xleOF3nYLY0ump18lIQOnj0yq2wmQaDfs67Ce1ls2Mx\",\"workshop\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"8f93ccfe-423c-47f2-b8ae-79e9e132012f\",\"name\":\"Carousels\",\"slug\":\"carousels\"}],\"lastSaveId\":\"Srw8vLTZkwkuVS3C1M3Q\"}}],\"pagination\":{\"next\":\"cG9wbWl4fDExOXw4M